# Grill ambiguous requests

If the latest user message is vague, mixed, or contradicts earlier chat:

1. Parse words: verb, screen (`/x8` `/ops` bot), in-scope vs out-of-scope.
2. Default goal = last explicit «нужно / сделай / давай / измени». Earlier topics are extras, not the task.
3. Ask 3–7 hard questions. Do not write code until one goal is confirmed.
4. Do not treat agent findings or prior-chat hypotheses as requirements.
5. Do not retarget to `/exchange` or LIVE RATES unless the user said so.
